    "body": "While `gp` is already mapped to paste from the system's clipboard, `gP` has not been adjusted accordingly. For symmetry, this should be added as well in normal mode.\r\n\r\nThis should not apply to visual mode as the selection is replaced, so we can keep `gP` in visual mode as is.\r\n\r\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2025-01-23T17:24:42Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the PR!\r\n\r\nAlthough reasonable, I think this kind of customization is better left to the user. There might be better uses for `gP` mapping in the future 'mini.nvim' modules.",
